{"3424990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Together in Forgotten Lands", "steam_appid": 3424990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world forgotten by time, an ancient cave lies hidden atop a mystical mountain, waiting to be explored. Two adventurers, bound by destiny, embark on a journey into its depths, uncovering secrets lost to history. Inside, they encounter bizarre plants, mysterious creatures, and arcane forces that challenge both their wits and teamwork. The deeper they venture, the more they realize that the cave is not just a place—it’s a living entity, shifting and transforming as if aware of their presence. What secrets does it hold? What trials must they overcome? Only through trust and collaboration can they hope to unravel the cave’s mysteries and make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Together in Forgotten Lands</strong></i> is a co-op puzzle adventure where two players must navigate through four distinct biomes, each offering unique challenges and enigmas. Light-based puzzles, intricate labyrinths, platforming trials, and musical riddles await those who dare to enter. Every puzzle requires teamwork, every obstacle demands coordination, and every step forward unearths another piece of a forgotten past. Do you have what it takes to escape the cave’s grasp?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424990/extras/44f8fa097f5bbd79dd5e04826a4b6150.avif?t=1786115667\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424990/extras_big/44f8fa097f5bbd79dd5e04826a4b6150.webp?t=1786115667 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature List</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two-Player Co-op:</strong> Designed exclusively for two players. Work together to solve mind-bending puzzles and navigate a dynamic, ever-changing cave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Biomes:</strong> Explore four breathtaking biomes, each with its own distinct atmosphere, mechanics, and creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Puzzles:</strong> A wide variety of challenges including light manipulation, spatial puzzles, rhythm-based mechanics, and platforming segments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living World:</strong> The cave reacts to your presence, shifting, changing, and unveiling new paths as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mysterious Story:</strong> Unravel the history of a forgotten world through cryptic messages, environmental storytelling, and the enigmatic forces that dwell within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424990/extras/77cd0cbdedc4df705e3777b382a47909.avif?t=1786115667\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424990/extras_big/77cd0cbdedc4df705e3777b382a47909.webp?t=1786115667 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MECHANICS</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through an ancient cave filled with breathtaking landscapes, enigmatic ruins, and hidden paths. Each step forward reveals a new layer of mystery waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424990/extras/e88fa1cb90c898acedcec18b60dd899d.poster.avif?t=1786115667\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424990/extras/e88fa1cb90c898acedcec18b60dd899d.webm?t=1786115667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424990/extras/e88fa1cb90c898acedcec18b60dd899d.mp4?t=1786115667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle is built for two. Communicate, strategize, and synchronize your actions to navigate obstacles that can only be overcome together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424990/extras/38de522c1c343440469a9bc42e15e780.poster.avif?t=1786115667\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424990/extras/38de522c1c343440469a9bc42e15e780.webm?t=1786115667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424990/extras/38de522c1c343440469a9bc42e15e780.mp4?t=1786115667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From intricate musical riddles to complex light-reflection challenges, solving puzzles requires logical thinking, creativity, and teamwork. Every solution brings you one step closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424990/extras/7fee8460d0fdf0e826f056ce23eed191.poster.avif?t=1786115667\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424990/extras/7fee8460d0fdf0e826f056ce23eed191.webm?t=1786115667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424990/extras/7fee8460d0fdf0e826f056ce23eed191.mp4?t=1786115667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Confront the True Nature</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the world sheds its masks one by one. In this journey from the depths of the cave to the light of day, how far can you go while everything shapes itself against you? The Forgotten Lands know you; are you ready to face them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424990/extras/19f4eefc0f957e1d3061ed856e1421a0.poster.avif?t=1786115667\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424990/extras/19f4eefc0f957e1d3061ed856e1421a0.webm?t=1786115667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424990/extras/19f4eefc0f957e1d3061ed856e1421a0.mp4?t=1786115667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is not a sequel to <i>Together in Between</i> and is designed exclusively for two players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world forgotten by time, an ancient cave lies hidden atop a mystical mountain, waiting to be explored. Two adventurers, bound by destiny, embark on a journey into its depths, uncovering secrets lost to history. Inside, they encounter bizarre plants, mysterious creatures, and arcane forces that challenge both their wits and teamwork. The deeper they venture, the more they realize that the cave is not just a place—it’s a living entity, shifting and transforming as if aware of their presence. What secrets does it hold? What trials must they overcome? Only through trust and collaboration can they hope to unravel the cave’s mysteries and make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Together in Forgotten Lands</strong></i> is a co-op puzzle adventure where two players must navigate through four distinct biomes, each offering unique challenges and enigmas. Light-based puzzles, intricate labyrinths, platforming trials, and musical riddles await those who dare to enter. Every puzzle requires teamwork, every obstacle demands coordination, and every step forward unearths another piece of a forgotten past. Do you have what it takes to escape the cave’s grasp?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424990/extras/44f8fa097f5bbd79dd5e04826a4b6150.avif?t=1786115667\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424990/extras_big/44f8fa097f5bbd79dd5e04826a4b6150.webp?t=1786115667 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature List</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two-Player Co-op:</strong> Designed exclusively for two players. Work together to solve mind-bending puzzles and navigate a dynamic, ever-changing cave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Biomes:</strong> Explore four breathtaking biomes, each with its own distinct atmosphere, mechanics, and creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Puzzles:</strong> A wide variety of challenges including light manipulation, spatial puzzles, rhythm-based mechanics, and platforming segments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living World:</strong> The cave reacts to your presence, shifting, changing, and unveiling new paths as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mysterious Story:</strong> Unravel the history of a forgotten world through cryptic messages, environmental storytelling, and the enigmatic forces that dwell within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item